## Services

### Network Design
Centillion provides end-to-end OSP fiber network design services, including aerial and underground route analysis, make-ready engineering, and construction document generation. Our designers utilize AutoCAD, Civil 3D, and GIS-based platforms to develop accurate and constructible designs.

### Permitting
Centillion manages the full permitting lifecycle for fiber deployments, including:
- Right-of-way (ROW) permits with municipalities, counties, and state DOTs
- Pole attachment applications (NESC/utility coordination)
- Tribal land and BIA permitting (for tribal broadband projects)
- NEPA environmental review coordination
- State and federal permitting compliance

### Construction Management
Bid package preparation, RFP support, contractor procurement, construction oversight, QA/QC inspection, and closeout documentation.

### GIS/Data Services
Network data management, GIS mapping, spatial analysis, and as-built documentation. Data delivered in client-specified formats.

